  "event:evt.gen_24.isaac_marries_rebekah": {
   "status": "approved",
   "produced_by": {
    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "skill": "urim-chronologist@5",
    "run": "main"
   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:45:51+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "Gen 25:20 puts Isaac's marriage at forty, i.e. anchor.isaac_birth + 40 years. The date this chain produces should be compared with that in review; the corpus text for Gen 23 dates the burial from the Terah-based anchor chain and may differ by a year or two. Neither is changed here. A later chapter (Gen 25:20) will carry the explicit age."
   ],
